# Snap turning: one flick of the right stick turns the astronaut 30 degrees, once however long the stick is held; a flick
# the other way turns it back.
# Needs: Earth Planet; Options > VR > Comfort at its defaults (snap turn 30 degrees, smooth turn off).
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
wait 2

# before: nothing pushed, the astronaut faces the same way
read character
mark
wait 1
read character
expect forward moved < 0.05

# a flick right and the stick held there: one 30 degree turn (the forward vector moves by about 0.52), not a steady one
stick right 1 0
wait 2
read character
expect forward moved > 0.35
expect forward moved < 0.7
expect log Snap turn right 30 deg within 5
stick right 0 0
wait 0.5

# a flick left turns it back
stick right -1 0
wait 1
stick right 0 0
wait 0.5
read character
expect forward moved < 0.1
expect log Snap turn left 30 deg within 5
